- Open your eyes and look ahead.

302
00:20:22.417 --> 00:20:23.417
Look there.

303
00:20:30.042 --> 00:20:31.042
<i>Saumya!</i>

304
00:20:31.792 --> 00:20:32.792
<i>Shailee!</i>

305
00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.583
