You have my heart</i>

314
00:21:53.708 --> 00:21:58.083
<i>My heart longs for you</i>

315
00:21:58.667 --> 00:22:03.542
<i>Lost in reverie
It only listens to you</i>

316
00:22:03.625 --> 00:22:07.833
<i>My heart trusts only you</i>

317
00:22:07.917 --> 00:22:12.875
<i>The magic of your love
Has enchanted my heart</i>

318
00:22:12.958 --> 00:22:18.083
<i>Says my heart
Maybe this is what love feels like</i>

319
00:22:18.167 --> 00:22:22.375
<i>The magic of your love
Has enchanted my heart</i>

320
00:22:22.458 --> 00:22:27.667
<i>Says my heart
Maybe this is what love feels like…</i>

321
00:22:32.292 --> 00:22:33.667
Fucking hell!

322
00:22:48.125 --> 00:22:49.125
Dhruv…

323
00:22:55.833 --> 00:23:00.792
<i>You flow in me, like we are one</i>

324
00:23:00.875 --> 00:23:05.208
<i>I melt into you, like we are one</i>

325
00:23:05.792 --> 00:23:10.958
<i>I wish to disappear in you</i>

326
00:23:11.042 --> 00:23:15.667
<i>I wish to be one with you</i>

327
00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:20.208
