378
00:29:15.208 --> 00:29:19.917
<i>This world feels so beautiful</i>

379
00:29:21.250 --> 00:29:26.042
<i>I wish to disappear in you</i>

380
00:29:26.125 --> 00:29:31.167
<i>Every breath of mine
